The line between life and death blurs for you.

You can only die when you reach [-287, -370, -432, -483, -528 (TL1-5; CON 100)] life but your maximum life is reduced by [144, 186, 217, 242, 265 (TL1-5; CON 100)].

When you are below 1 life you gain [6%, 8%, 9%, 10%, 12% (TL1-5)] to all resistances.

The life amount is based on your Constitution attribute.
